            <p></p></div>

            <div type="commentary">
            <p>Building inscription of Uratmis son of Urhilina, king of Hamath. On cast, in pencil:
                    cast of a stone taken from the house of Dahan near the house of Shiman at Killas
                    in Hamath Syria, now in the Ottoman Museum Constantinople.</p></div>
            

